  "title": "CPMC Van Ness Campus",
  "subTitle": null,
  "description": null,
  "ownerDescription": "Our CPMC Van Ness Campus in SF is the premier destination for our most advanced specialty care. This 274-bed hospital brings together emergency care and award-winning organ transplant programs, groundbreaking technologies and innovative therapies available at only a few centers across the U.S. Named as one of America\u2019s 250 Best Hospital by Healthgrades, our nationally recognized services set our campus apart. Our teams provide world-class care in liver, kidney, pancreas and heart transplantation, hepatobiliary surgery, advanced interventional endoscopy, head and neck surgery, and metabolic health. As a hub for research and clinical trials, we\u2019re pioneering first-in-the-nation treatments such as integrated therapies for complex liver cancers",
